        "raw_slide_content": "<div class=\"alert alert-info\" style=\"margin-bottom: 18px;\">\n  <strong>🎙️ TRANSKRIP & PENJELASAN LENGKAP SLIDE DOSEN (STEP-BY-STEP VERBATIM)</strong><br>\n  <strong>Mata Kuliah:</strong> Bahasa Inggris 1 • <strong>Pertemuan:</strong> 1 • <strong>Dosen Pengampu:</strong> Tim Dosen Bahasa Inggris FTIK<br>\n  <em>Uraian materi per-topik dan per-slide berdasarkan modul resmi perkuliahan FTIK Unindra yang dijelaskan secara mendalam, santai, dan mudah dipahami layaknya dosen mengajar langsung di ruang kuliah.</em>\n</div>\n<div class=\"slide-block\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 18px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border-left: 4px solid #6366F1; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold; color: #818CF8; background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15); padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);\">SLIDE / TOPIK 1 DARI 4</span>\n    <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #94A3B8;\">Modul Resmi Perkuliahan</span>\n  </div>\n  <h3 style=\"color: #F8FAFC; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.15rem;\">The Big Picture: Present-Past-Future Formula for Tech Professionals</h3>\n  <div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7;\">\n    \n<p>In international technical interviews, professional networking events (LinkedIn, GitHub), and academic symposiums, delivering a concise elevator pitch is essential. The industry-standard structure is the <strong>Present-Past-Future Formula</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"card card-accent\">\n  <strong>The 3-Part Pitch Formula:</strong><br>\n  1. <strong>PRESENT (Current Status):</strong> Who you are right now and your current technical domain.<br>\n  2. <strong>PAST (Foundation & Experience):</strong> Projects built, technologies mastered, or challenges overcome.<br>\n  3. <strong>FUTURE (Vision & Goals):</strong> What you aim to contribute, solve, or learn next.\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"slide-block\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 18px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border-left: 4px solid #6366F1; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold; color: #818CF8; background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15); padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);\">SLIDE / TOPIK 2 DARI 4</span>\n    <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #94A3B8;\">Modul Resmi Perkuliahan</span>\n  </div>\n  <h3 style=\"color: #F8FAFC; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.15rem;\">Script Model & Industry Dialogue Transcript</h3>\n  <div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7;\">\n    \n<div class=\"card-dark\">\n  <span style=\"color: #38bdf8; font-weight: bold;\">Professional Profile Script Sample:</span>\n  <p style=\"color: #e2e8f0; font-style: italic; margin-top: 6px;\">\n    \"Good morning, everyone. My name is <strong>Muhammad Haikal</strong>. I am currently an undergraduate student in <strong>Information Systems at Universitas Indraprasta PGRI (Unindra)</strong>. [PRESENT]<br>\n    Over the past year, I have built web-based digital archive tools and explored algorithm optimization using Pascal and modern JavaScript frameworks. [PAST]<br>\n    Moving forward, I aim to specialize in scalable full-stack software architecture and cloud database systems to contribute effectively to high-impact enterprise solutions. [FUTURE]\"\n  </p>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"slide-block\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 18px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border-left: 4px solid #6366F1; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold; color: #818CF8; background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15); padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);\">SLIDE / TOPIK 3 DARI 4</span>\n    <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #94A3B8;\">Modul Resmi Perkuliahan</span>\n  </div>\n  <h3 style=\"color: #F8FAFC; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.15rem;\">Grammar Foundation: Present Simple Mechanics & Subject-Verb Agreement</h3>\n  <div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7;\">\n    \n<p>The Present Simple is the workhorse of technical writing, used to describe <strong>general truths, system specifications, permanent states, and habitual routines</strong>:</p>\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Subject Category</th>\n      <th>Affirmative (+)</th>\n      <th>Negative (-)</th>\n      <th>Interrogative (?)</th>\n      <th>Engineering Example</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>I / You / We / They (Plural)</strong></td>\n      <td><code>S + Verb 1 + Object</code></td>\n      <td><code>S + do not (don't) + V1</code></td>\n      <td><code>Do + S + V1?</code></td>\n      <td><em>\"We deploy microservices using Docker containers.\"</em></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td><strong>He / She / It (Singular)</strong></td>\n      <td><code>S + Verb 1 (s/es) + Object</code></td>\n      <td><code>S + does not (doesn't) + V1</code></td>\n      <td><code>Does + S + V1?</code></td>\n      <td><em>\"The PostgreSQL database handles ACID transactions efficiently.\"</em></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 10px;\"><strong>Rules for Adding -s / -es to Third-Person Singular Verbs:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Verbs ending in <em>-ch, -sh, -ss, -x, -z, -o</em>: add <strong>-es</strong> (<em>watches, pushes, passes, fixes, goes</em>).</li>\n  <li>Verbs ending in <em>consonant + y</em>: change y to i and add <strong>-es</strong> (<em>queries, studies, modifies</em>).</li>\n  <li>Verbs ending in <em>vowel + y</em>: simply add <strong>-s</strong> (<em>plays, displays</em>).</li>\n</ul>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"slide-block\" style=\"margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 18px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border-left: 4px solid #6366F1; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding-bottom: 8px;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold; color: #818CF8; background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15); padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);\">SLIDE / TOPIK 4 DARI 4</span>\n    <span style=\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #94A3B8;\">Modul Resmi Perkuliahan</span>\n  </div>\n  <h3 style=\"color: #F8FAFC; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 1.15rem;\">Exam Traps & Technical Vocabulary (Adverbs of Frequency)</h3>\n  <div style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7;\">\n    \n<div class=\"alert alert-warning\">\n  <strong>⚠️ Placement of Adverbs of Frequency:</strong><br>\n  Adverbs of frequency (<em>always, usually, often, frequently, rarely, never</em>) must be positioned:\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>BEFORE</strong> main verbs: <em>\"The caching server <strong>always</strong> responds in under 10 milliseconds.\"</em></li>\n    <li><strong>AFTER</strong> auxiliary / to-be verbs: <em>\"The backup cron job is <strong>never</strong> skipped during maintenance.\"</em></li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>"
